window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Michelle Collins used to love the week after Christmas. That was when Ryan Cross, rich kid from Boston, came to Reindeer Falls to spend a week with his great-aunt Dottie. From the ages of six to 17, with a suitcase full of video games and a childlike wonder for small-town traditions, Ryan stole her heart...at least until the year he stopped showing up.</p> <p>Ten years later, when Ryan unexpectedly returns to town, and Heavenly Peace - Reindeer Falls’ beloved retirement community - finds itself at risk of shutting down, Michelle’s life is thrown for a loop. With a wild goose chase on behalf of Great-Aunt Dottie, and old feelings for Ryan creeping up like the Ghost of Christmas Past, will this holiday season bring a second chance at love...or the untimely end of an era?</p>"; 
